mpleted successfully with a 200 status code and passed, taking 4.470 seconds. The sandbox setup phase required the most time, specifically the OVN network creation which was the longest single operation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"ssh debian@192.168.0.199 \"cd /home/debian/bluectfd/blueagent && source .venv/bin/activate && python3 -c '\nimport asyncio\nfrom tests.usability.client import BlueAgentTestClient\nasync def clean():\n    c = BlueAgentTestClient()\n    await c.teardown_challenge(team_k=1)\n    await c.delete_team(team_k=1)\n    print(\\\"Team 1 deleted\\\")\nasyncio.run(clean())\n'\"","Cwd":"/home/davidel","IsDaemon":false,"RunPersistent":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Cleaning up team 1","toolSummary":"Clean up team 1"}}]}
